    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "372682e1-0950-9362-e81b-2907375bebd3",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The Academic Speaking B1 course focuses on developing learners' speaking skills in using English for Academic Purposes. The main aim of the course is to provide course participants with the language and skills needed to participate with greater confidence in academic classes and discussions. The course followed a blended approach. This means that there is face-to-face classroom teaching in addition to an integrated online component. The participants are expected to commit to studying four hours (2 hours face-to-face and 2 hours online learning) a week for eight weeks.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The participants found the Academic Speaking B1 course relevant and useful to their English language needs. The interaction in the class was good where the participants responded well during class discussions. Please see below what our two participants have to say about the course. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
